WEBVTT

00:01:27.561 --> 00:01:31.792
Frankl used this Nietzsche quote
to explain to us

00:01:31.816 --> 00:01:35.180
that when we can no longer change
our circumstances,

00:01:35.204 --> 00:01:38.204
we are challenged to change ourselves.

00:01:40.188 --> 00:01:43.403
Mark Pollock: Eventually,
I did rebuild my identity,

00:01:43.427 --> 00:01:46.482
and the Why for me
was about competing again,

00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:50.125
because pursuing success
and risking failure

00:01:50.149 --> 00:01:53.085
was simply how I felt normal.

00:01:53.957 --> 00:01:56.369
And I finished the rebuild

00:01:56.393 --> 00:01:59.327
on the 10th anniversary
of losing my sight.

00:01:59.861 --> 00:02:03.887
I took part in a 43-day expedition race